              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "आजोबा अधूनमधून जुन्या गोष्टी सांगतात. ājobā adhūnmadhūn junyā goṣṭī sāṅgtāt. Grandpa tells old stories now and then."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A rhyming pair; कधीकधी means much the same."
            }
          ]
        },
